<title>MOROCCO: Syrian vice-president to visit Morocco.</title>
<headline>Syrian vice-president to visit Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syrian Vice President Abdel-Halim Khaddam and Foreign Minister Farouq al-Shara are to visit Morocco on Monday, the Moroccan foreign ministry said.</p>
<p>It added that Khaddam was bringing a message from Syrian President Hafez al-Assad for King Hassan, but gave no other details.</p>
</text>
